{"kind":"assert","text":"Ruling on 7f79544e: yes. Make the two edits.\n\n1. Add `publisher/publisher.test.ts` to the include list of\n   `examples/lending/vitest.config.ts`.\n2. Add `publisher/**/*.ts` to the includes of\n   `examples/lending/tsconfig.json`.\n\nAct ced41b00, item 2, already permits both edits and the edit of\n`test-support.ts`. The limit stays: P1 changes no file that\n`dap pack` reads for the shipped Lending package. Create no second\nVitest or TypeScript configuration under `publisher/`.\n\nAct d2d431a9 answers the Git question c7a68450: the first script uses\na local bare repository, and P1 builds no authenticated connector.\nBoth P1 questions are closed. Start the source.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}